  "2026-10-28T23:41:23.284Z",codex-agent,"Implemented journaled sends with eight deterministic protocol boundaries, stable operation identities and revision-guarded SDK state. Every interrupted possible send converges to stored evidence or explicit uncertainty without replay; two concurrent identities preserve both observations."
  "2026-10-29T00:26:01.227Z",codex-agent,"Independent-process acceptance passed 9/9: distinct writers and shared operation identity, plus SIGKILL at all eight send/record boundaries. Native dead leases recover and stable reruns admit exactly one observation, with at most one request. Logical interleaving and interruption schedules also pass 16/16."
